WEBVTT - One notification, one distraction (en)

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.800
Sofía is studying and making progress.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.900
Her attention is on a single task.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.400
A notification arrives. Then another.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.700
They don't need to be opened to
compete for her attention.

5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.400
Sofía opens the message to reply quickly.

6
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.200
From the message she moves to email
and a social network.

7
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.600
Her attention drifts away from the task.

8
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.000
Her attention returns to the document.

9
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.400
Rereading to pick up the thread
takes extra effort.

10
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.900
It happens to almost everyone.

11
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.800
Now she mutes non-essential
notifications.

12
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.600
and sets a time to check
her messages.

13
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.800
Small adjustments help protect
your focus.
